cff-version: 1.2.0
title: fdstoolkit
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Gustavo
    family-names: Franco
    alias: gufranco
repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/fdstoolkit
abstract: >-
  A Famicom Disk System toolkit: reads and writes .fds and .qd images, verifies
  checksums and structure, answers whether two dumps are the same release,
  predicts what a console does with a disk, dumps and writes real disks
  through an FDSStick, and keeps the drive in adjustment. Distributes no disk
  image, no BIOS and no link to either.
keywords:
  - famicom-disk-system
  - famicom
  - preservation
  - emulation
  - quick-disk
license: MIT
